# Atlas Core Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Rune Cross  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 21:40  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Comprehensive semantic and component token architecture for Atlas Core, incorporating cross-surface edge-case handling for SaaS and Face-to-Face touchpoints as informed by Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$meta": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "designer": "Rune Cross",
    "reference": "Business Document: Company Document (utilised for aligning SaaS multi-tenant states and physical kiosk/F2F ambient contrast ratios)",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "atlas": {
    "component": {
      "button": {
        "primary": {
          "background": {
            "default": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.600}" },
            "hover": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.700}" },
            "active": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.800}" },
            "disabled": { "value": "{color.neutral.300}" },
            "edge_case_offline_syncing": { "value": "{color.warning.400}", "description": "Visual cue when F2F POS loses network connectivity as defined in Business Document: Company Document." }
          },
          "text": {
            "default": { "value": "{color.neutral.0}" },
            "disabled": { "value": "{color.neutral.500}" }
          },
          "border-radius": { "value": "{dimension.radius.md}" },
          "padding": {
            "vertical": { "value": "{dimension.spacing.sm}" },
            "horizontal": { "value": "{dimension.spacing.lg}" }
          }
        }
      },
      "surface": {
        "card": {
          "background": { "value": "{color.surface.default}" },
          "border": {
            "default": { "value": "1px solid {color.neutral.200}" },
            "high_contrast_kiosk": { "value": "2px solid {color.neutral.900}", "description": "Edge-case high-ambient-light token for Face-to-Face terminals referenced in Business Document: Company Document." }
          },
          "elevation": { "value": "{shadow.elevation.1}" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```